@model HopTacDoanhNghiep.ViewModels.Common.PageResult<HopTacDoanhNghiep.Areas.Student.ViewModels.DonUngTuyen.DonUngTuyenVM>
@using HopTacDoanhNghiep.Enums.HoSo
@using HopTacDoanhNghiep.Enums.ViecLam

@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Đơn ứng tuyển";
    var keyword = Context.Request.Query["keyword"].ToString();
}

<div class="container">
    <div class="box">
        <div class="box-header mb-4">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-paper-plane"></i> Đơn ứng tuyển
        </div>
        <div class="box-body">

            @if (Model?.Records != null && Model.Records.Any())
            {
                <div class="don-ung-tuyen-grid">
                    @foreach (var item in Model.Records)
                    {
                        <article class="don-ung-tuyen-card">
                            <div class="don-ung-tuyen-card-header">
                                <div>
                                    <div class="don-ung-tuyen-date">
                                        <i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-days"></i>
                                        @item.CreatedAt.ToString("dd/MM/yyyy HH:mm")
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <div>
                                    @switch (item.TrangThai)
                                    {
                                        case HoSoStatus.ChoPhanHoi:
                                            <span class="badge bg-warning text-dark">Chờ phản hồi</span>
                                            break;
                                        case HoSoStatus.ChapNhan:
                                            <span class="badge bg-success">Chấp nhận</span>
                                            break;
                                        case HoSoStatus.TuChoi:
                                            <span class="badge bg-danger">Từ chối</span>
                                            break;
                                        case HoSoStatus.RutHoSo:
                                            <span class="badge bg-secondary">Rút hồ sơ</span>
                                            break;
                                    }
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="don-ung-tuyen-card-body">
                                <h3 class="don-ung-tuyen-title">
                                    <a href="/sinh-vien/don-ung-tuyen/@item.MaTTD">@item.TieuDeTinTuyenDung</a>
                                </h3>
                                <div>
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-piggy-bank"></i> @((item.LuongToiThieu.ToString("N0") ?? "0") + " - " + (item.LuongToiDa.ToString("N0") ?? "0")) VNĐ
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-clock-rotate-left"></i> @item.NgayBatDau.ToString("dd/MM/yyyy") - @item.NgayHetHan.ToString("dd/MM/yyyy")
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-cubes"></i>
                                    @switch (item.LoaiViecLam)
                                    {
                                        case ViecLamType.BanThoiGian:
                                            <span> Bán thời gian</span>
                                            break;
                                        case ViecLamType.ToanThoiGian:
                                            <span> Toàn thời gian</span>
                                            break;
                                        case ViecLamType.ThucTap:
                                            <span> Thực tập</span>
                                            break;
                                    }
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            @* <div class="don-ung-tuyen-card-footer">
                                <a href="/sinh-vien/don-ung-tuyen/@item.MaTTD" class="btn btn-outline-secondary w-100">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-eye"></i> Chi tiết
                                </a>
                            </div> *@
                        </article>
                    }
                </div>

                <div class="pagination-wrapper">
                    @await Html.PartialAsync("_Pagination", Model)
                </div>
            }
            else
            {
                <div class="text-center w-100 fs-4 fw-bold text-muted mt-5">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-folder-open empty-icon"></i>
                    Không có đơn ứng tuyển nào
                </div>
            }
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

@section Styles {
    <link href="/css/student/DonUngTuyen/DonUngTuyen.css" rel="stylesheet" />
}